Association StudentParentAssociation
    documentation 'This association relates students to their parents, guardians, or caretakers.
    domain entity Student
        documentation 'The Student associated with the Parent.
    domain entity Parent
        documentation 'The Parent associated with the Student.
    enumeration Relation
        documentation 'The nature of an individual's relationship to a student; for example:
                      '
                      'Father, Mother, Step Father, Step Mother, Foster Father, Foster Mother, Guardian, 
                      'etc.
        is optional
    bool PrimaryContactStatus
        documentation 'Indicator of whether the person is a primary parental contact for the Student.
        is optional
    bool LivesWith
        documentation 'Indicator of whether the Student lives with the associated parent.
        is optional
    bool EmergencyContactStatus
        documentation 'Indicator of whether the person is a designated emergency contact for the 
                      'Student.
        is optional
    integer ContactPriority
        documentation 'The numeric order of the preferred sequence or priority of contact.
        is optional
    string ContactRestrictions
        documentation 'Restrictions for student and/or teacher contact with the individual (e.g., the 
                      'student may not be picked up by the individual).
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 250